                   "Grill the chops over high heat or sear in a heavy skillet, 3 to 4 minutes per side, until the marinade caramelizes into dark, sticky edges without burning outright.",
                   "Rest the meat for 5 minutes while you fluff the rice with a fork; the grains should be small, dry, and separate.",
                   "Plate a mound of rice with a chop leaning on it, spoon scallion oil over the rice, add cucumber and pickles, and pour nuoc cham over everything at the table.",
